// The pack the tests use (ticket 0233): English in capitals. It is never
// offered to players; it only shows where debug tools are on. One line,
// `title.crashed`, is in Chinese (ticket 0236), so a test can show wide
// glyphs on the title screen; it draws them from the wide set `zhhans`.
// Its punctuation `“ ” ‘ ’ … —` is wide, as in Chinese (ticket 0239), so
// a test can show `“好”` six cells wide; its capitals' `…` are wide too.
(
    name: "TEST",
    made_by: Machine,
    wide_font: Some("zhhans"),
    wide_punctuation: true,
)
